<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">
<title><%= heading %> — T&S Traffic Control</title>
<style>
  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background: #F3F4F6; color: #111827; min-height: 100vh; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
  .topbar { background: #0F1115; color: #fff; padding: 12px 16px; font-weight: 800; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
  .topbar span { color: #10B981; }
  main { flex: 1; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 24px 16px; }
  .card { background: #fff; border: 1px solid #E5E7EB; border-radius: 16px; padding: 34px 26px; max-width: 460px; width: 100%; text-align: center; }
  .disc { width: 56px; height: 56px; border-radius: 999px; margin: 0 auto 14px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 26px; }
  .disc.ok { background: #ECFDF5; } .disc.bad { background: #FEF3C7; }
  h1 { font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 8px; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
  p { font-size: 14px; color: #4B5563; line-height: 1.6; }
  .when { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 12.5px; color: #9CA3AF; }
  a.btn { display: inline-block; margin-top: 18px; background: #059669; color: #fff; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; text-decoration: none; padding: 13px 22px; border-radius: 12px; }
  footer { text-align: center; color: #9CA3AF; font-size: 11px; padding: 16px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="topbar">T&amp;S <span>Traffic Control</span></div>
<main>
  <div class="card">
    <div class="disc <%= state === 'signed' ? 'ok' : 'bad' %>"><%= state === 'signed' ? '✓' : '🔒' %></div>
    <h1><%= heading %></h1>
    <p><%= body %></p>
    <% if (state === 'signed' && contract) { %>
      <% if (signedAt) { %><div class="when">Signed <%= signedAt %> (Sydney time)</div><% } %>
      <a class="btn" href="/contract-sign/<%= contract.token %>/pdf">Download your signed agreement (PDF)</a>
    <% } %>
  </div>
</main>
<footer>T&amp;S Traffic Control Pty Ltd · If you weren't expecting this page, you can safely close it.</footer>
</body>
</html>
